#. module: sale_order_template_pricelist
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_order_template_pricelist
msgid ""
"=============================\n"
"Sale Order Template Pricelist\n"
"=============================\n"
"\n"
".. \n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"   !! This file is generated by oca-gen-addon-readme !!\n"
"   !! changes will be overwritten.                   !!\n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"   !! source digest: sha256:018ce10097b3a4a08b72c6c461ac99fa917967f0b5f021c39811eec192068656\n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"\n"
".. |badge1| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/maturity-Beta-yellow.png\n"
"    :target: https://odoo-community.org/page/development-status\n"
"    :alt: Beta\n"
".. |badge2| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/licence-AGPL--3-blue.png\n"
"    :target: http://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0-standalone.html\n"
"    :alt: License: AGPL-3\n"
".. |badge3| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/github-KMEE%2Fkmee--odoo--addons-lightgray.png?logo=github\n"
"    :target: https://github.com/KMEE/kmee-odoo-addons/tree/20.0/sale_order_template_pricelist\n"
"    :alt: KMEE/kmee-odoo-addons\n"
"\n"
"|badge1| |badge2| |badge3|\n"
"\n"
"This Odoo module ensures that when a quotation template is selected on a\n"
"sale order, the pricelist defined in the template is automatically\n"
"applied to the order.\n"
"\n"
"This behavior overrides the customer's default pricelist to enforce\n"
"consistent pricing based on the selected quotation template.\n"
"\n"
"It is useful for campaigns like \"Black Friday\", where special templates\n"
"require specific pricelists regardless of customer configuration.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"To configure this module, you need to:\n"
"\n"
"1. Go to **Sales > Quotation Templates**\n"
"2. Edit or create a template\n"
"3. In the form view, set the **Pricelist** field\n"
"4. Save the template\n"
"\n"
"When you select this template in a sale order, the order's pricelist\n"
"will automatically be updated to match the one defined in the template,\n"
"even if the customer has a different default pricelist.\n"
"\n"
